eloper/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/state.json" "file_sha256" "490631e9caae6aff35de462ff8f0e18814519090b9886a5251afc49e65b0424e" "basis" 2353 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-79747" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "40\\,\\text{d}a+12\\,\\text{d}h"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/state.json" "file_sha256" "490631e9caae6aff35de462ff8f0e18814519090b9886a5251afc49e65b0424e" "basis" 2353 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-168150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given a rectangular solid, find the differential $\\text{d}V$ for the volume $V$ of the rectangular solid if the lengths of the sides are $a=6,$ $b=3,$ and $c=8.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/state.json" "file_sha256" "490631e9caae6aff35de462ff8f0e18814519090b9886a5251afc49e65b0424e" "basis" 2353 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-168150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The volume of the rectangular solid is $V=abc.$ Let's find the differential:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}V(a,b,c) & =(\\frac{∂V}{∂a})\\,\\text{d}a+(\\frac{∂V}{∂b})\\,\\text{d}b+(\\frac{∂V}{∂c})\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =bc\\,\\text{d}a+ac\\,\\text{d}b+ab\\,\\text{d}c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $a=6,$ $b=3,$ and $c=8,$ the differential is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}V(6,3,8) & =3\\cdot 8\\,\\text{d}a+6\\cdot 8\\,\\text{d}b+6\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =24\\,\\text{d}a+48\\,\\text{d}b+18\\,\\text{d}c.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/state.json" "file_sha256" "490631e9caae6aff35de462ff8f0e18814519090b9886a5251afc49e65b0424e" "basis" 2353 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-168150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "64ebbe4c5c3339e384772d524cb74d16e51e6558d9210f91128095b076ca4c95" "basis" 2353 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-168150" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/state.json" "file_sha256" "490631e9caae6aff35de462ff8f0e18814519090b9886a5251afc49e65b0424e" "basis" 2353 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-168150" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "12\\,\\text{d}a+24\\,\\text{d}b+9\\,\\text{d}c"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068753/state.json" "file_sha256" "490631e9caae6aff35de462ff8f0e18814519090b9886a5251afc49e65b0424e" "basis" 2353 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/